							<div class="elementor-shortcode"><pre class="ti-widget" style="display: none"><template id="trustindex-google-widget-html"><div class=" ti-widget  ti-goog ti-review-text-mode-readmore ti-text-align-left" data-no-translation="true" data-time-locale="%d %s ago|today|day|days|week|weeks|month|months|year|years" data-plugin-version="13.3.1" data-layout-id="5" data-layout-category="slider" data-set-id="drop-shadow" data-pid="" data-language="en" data-close-locale="Close" data-review-target-width="275" data-css-version="2" data-reply-by-locale="Owner's reply" data-only-rating-locale="This user only left a rating." data-pager-autoplay-timeout="6"> <div class="ti-widget-container ti-col-4"> <div class="ti-footer ti-footer-grid source-Google"> <div class="ti-fade-container"> <div class="ti-rating-text"> <strong class="ti-rating ti-rating-large"> GOOD </strong> </div> <span class="ti-stars star-lg"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image></span> <div class="ti-rating-text"> <span class="nowrap">Based on <strong>426 reviews</strong></span> </div> <div class="ti-large-logo"> <div class="ti-v-center"> <trustindex-image class="ti-logo-fb" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/logo.svg" width="150" height="25" loading="lazy" alt="Google"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Next review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Previous review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container-wrapper">  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1717286400" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW96o7lCK5kVpUHinl3WCj6Qii690OOKNOSvlSUDkbm5q7D5FR4=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Harish GS profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Harish GS </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Instead of visiting this hospital visit near by any clinic , if you have a corporate insurance, then they got an opportunity to loot it, they will make bill for maximum. And they won’t provide minimum facilities. They call deluxe ward , there is nothing, even there won’t be a  chair for attender. If we ask them to provide, they simply say patient will infect. , so we won’t provide. And comes to maintenance you have to ask them frequently for housekeeping. The rooms smells stinky and very bad odour. But they charge for that room is about 5.5 k per day. Lots of mosquitos, broken windows. Horrible experience.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1716768000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIsOYZ02t5IZ3JlonKAb6iPkr8asWmHQZHCiMTKuUmPiukJ6w=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Harish Venkataramana profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Harish Venkataramana </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->This hospital deserve zero star but I don’t have option.

This is the worst hospital they will loot all your money, please be very careful before going to this hospital and it’s my request don’t go this hospital ever…. My mother admitted due to Dengue, and they experimented with all tests (Unnecessary test’s). We took a private room, and they charge room charges-INR2,500(AC will never work in any of their rooms and with out hot water in washroom)

Duty Doctor-INR 1200(They are really good)
3 Consultants visits every day- INR 2,100 (DR. Akshatha visits @ 10AM, DR. Manjunath visits @ 5-6PM and Finally again DR. Akshatha visits @ 6:30PM to 7:00PM) and they charge for every visit INR 750). When I asked them why again 3rd visit is required, they it is there protocols and DR. Akshatha doesn’t even spends for a 1-2mins with patients, and she will suggest unnecessary tests to patient so that hospital can make money.

Service Charges INR 500- They say these charges for housekeeping, and they don’t keep room in hygiene condition in room, no hand wash, no Soaps or towel to patients and hot water doesn’t come in their washroom and they clean the room only once a day and bucket &amp; Jug was not clean.

INR 100- For removal of Garbage in the room.

Oxygen- My mother was not in need of Oxygen, she was breathing absolutely fine still they insisted her to take the Oxygen and she used for 4 to 5 hours for 2 days, and they charged INR 5,000.

Nursing Charges 1250 INR- Nursing team they don’t respond, especially in the night times.

In total they charge Around 8,000 Approx per day- Room Charges (2,500) + Doctor Visiting Charges (2,100) + Duty Doctor Charges (1,200) + Nursing Charges (1250) + Service Charges (500) + Garbage removal (100) + Unnecessary tests.

They will not let you to take non-medical things from outside hospital and they insist you to take from their pharmacy, but they will let you to take any type of foods to patient from outside and it is their protocol.

This hospital is money minded, they are here to loot the money, please don’t visit this hospital.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1716422400" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLL44ZT8URS-kFZuAxP_eaF_Uj8VzFHpAHzHVIPy6z3qVlCGw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Ravindra Reddy profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Ravindra Reddy </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Worst hospital  in emergency situation..they just try to pull money .completely money minded not At all suggestable.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1714780800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgNG8Zz4dKHPLavREcR55OvJLePxTf7kFN4alnlLGpQkQoIu8q=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Kavya Govindaraj profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Kavya Govindaraj </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->My mom got admitted, very bad service and no proper facility in the general ward and not even a single chair to sit to attendees. If this is the case, the amount they charge is not acceptable with the facility they give.
I don't recommend anyone to come to this hospital.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1714176000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUrmOS8ohOLwWaXD2OWXL6Z29z8MQVLK5n5ziZPOYZCJO8Y3oaN7A=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="MURTHY D.S.V profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> MURTHY D.S.V </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->This is one of the best hospitals
Very caring and smooth functioning
My brother was admitted for cardiac issues
All doctors and staff reacted immediately and today he is safe
Very great full to all the people working with lot of patience<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1714176000" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXaY_AueNJCdaL3BenNvRsX5xeUUw3NP1G2DRMbRsEG2ey5fn0-=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100" alt="Sonu Singh profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Sonu Singh </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->They have paid reviews. They will loot all your money on random tests that has to do nothing with the disease without even consulting. I admitted my dad as it thought it was an emergency and they took an advantage of that. I got my dad checked later from another doctor later and they gave what they did and it was totally uncessary.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1713484800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI9n6icetXf2PxdyS-1P97STElO1MR1G7OB31lO6rStUTVHdg=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Suresh Fh profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Suresh Fh </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->All the services was very gud in this hospital.all doctors and staff coordinated very well.thank you for entire team.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1712534400" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKP5WAfSsiyR7L2qNy-ixmuypcXmsXtx3iJpz1c_6269Dh6lQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Dinakar Murthy profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Dinakar Murthy </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/e.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Good treatment &amp; good staff<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  </div> <div class="ti-controls-line"> <div class="dot"></div> </div>   </div> </div> </div> </template></pre><div data-src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/loader.js?wp-widget" data-template-id="trustindex-google-widget-html" data-css-url="https://slsshospitals.com/wp-content/uploads/trustindex-google-widget.css?1784225772"></div></div>
